GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/partner-data/items/changes?pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Items Delta — items.read — initial handshake
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/items/changes?pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

# Complete the full items export before polling. Use the actual returned baseline/nextSince and policyVersion; encode any offset (or use Z).

### Items Delta — first poll
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/items/changes?since={{itemsSince}}&policyVersion={{itemsPolicyVersion}}&pageSize=1
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

# Continue only when hasMore=true; keep the same window and version, use returned key(s).

### Items Delta — continuation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/items/changes?since={{itemsSince}}&policyVersion={{itemsPolicyVersion}}&pageSize=1&through={{itemsThrough}}&afterItemId={{itemsAfterItemId}}
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Inventory Delta — inventory.read — initial handshake
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/changes?pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

# Complete the full inventory export before polling. Use the actual returned baseline/nextSince and policyVersion; encode any offset (or use Z).

### Inventory Delta — first poll
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/changes?since={{inventorySince}}&policyVersion={{inventoryPolicyVersion}}&pageSize=1
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

# Continue only when hasMore=true; keep the same window and version, use returned key(s).

### Inventory Delta — continuation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/changes?since={{inventorySince}}&policyVersion={{inventoryPolicyVersion}}&pageSize=1&through={{inventoryThrough}}&afterItemId={{inventoryAfterItemId}}&afterStoreId={{inventoryAfterStoreId}}
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Sales — alternative local timestamp range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/sales?fromTimestamp={{fromTimestamp}}&toTimestamp={{toTimestamp}}&page=1&pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Purchases — alternative local timestamp range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/purchases?fromTimestamp={{fromTimestamp}}&toTimestamp={{toTimestamp}}&page=1&pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Inventory Movements — alternative local timestamp range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/movements?fromTimestamp={{fromTimestamp}}&toTimestamp={{toTimestamp}}&page=1&pageSize=200
X-IMS-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

# Affected requests can return HTTP 503 during company maintenance. Retain the same page/window/cursor and honor Retry-After.
